m/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T12:25:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T12:25:37Z","body":"Will this fix the vertex light culling issues (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105063) on Forward+ Rendering or is it only for Compatibility and Mobile?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3581085378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3581497070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112098#issuecomment-3581497070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112098","id":3581497070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VeU7u","user":{"login":"pshaughn","id":2379194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNzkxOTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2379194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn","html_url":"https://github.com/pshaughn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pshaughn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T14:10:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T14:10:19Z","body":"> Will this fix the vertex light culling issues (#105063) on Forward+ Rendering or is it only for Compatibility and Mobile?\r\n\r\nJust answering as a bystander, and there might be a subtlety I've missed: by my reading, while it won't fix them, it will provide a step in the direction. Once the cull margin exists at all it _could_ be used in Forward+ when a cone or sphere model is being tested to find lit clusters. (For the sphere, I think just adding the margin to the sphere radius would do it. Growing the cone seems like the tricky part.)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3581497070/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4162808219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112098#issuecomment-4162808219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112098","id":4162808219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74H2mb","user":{"login":"ghostsoft","id":63552156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTUyMTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63552156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft","html_url":"https://github.com/ghostsoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T13:51:32Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T13:51:32Z","body":"I've updated this PR with a change that lets the extra cull margin be exposed to the cluster builder in the Forward+ renderer, meaning this PR now affects all renderers. The way it works is by adding to the radius and spot aperture during the building of the cluster thus artificially \"inflating\" the size of the light.\r\n\r\nNow the slider on the Light3Ds will allow the user to tweak the extra cull margin so vertex lighting no longer gets culled early in either of the renderers.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4162808219/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4761080474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112098#issuecomment-4761080474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112098","id":4761080474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG8hSmg","user":{"login":"ghostsoft","id":63552156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTUyMTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63552156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft","html_url":"https://github.com/ghostsoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghostsoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T06:03:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T06:03:20Z","body":"> Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` [ee713cc](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/ee713ccb7cbaddf59f8258ed6663461779d00856)), it works as expected in all renderers. Code looks good to me.\r\n> \r\n> **Testing project:** [test_pr_112098.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26482801/test_pr_112098.zip)\r\n\r\n@Calinou It's been some time now and I'm confused at why this was never approved - Is there anything I can do do help speed this along? Give this a poke? Just tell me what I need to do and I'll happily get to it :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4761080474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762429059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112098#issuecomment-4762429059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112098","id":4762429059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9zmgw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://a